# Generated by tools/lcars-gen from tokens/palette.json ("apps"). Do not edit.
# App look inside the LCARS session only. These are environment variables, so the
# stock Ubuntu session is unaffected (no theme files in ~/.config).
#   ADW_*: libadwaita apps (Files, Settings, Text Editor...). QT_QPA_PLATFORMTHEME:
#   Qt apps follow the GTK settings. No GTK_THEME: libadwaita drops its own
#   stylesheet when it is set, which leaves modern apps half-styled.
env = ADW_DEBUG_COLOR_SCHEME,{{apps.colorScheme}}
env = ADW_DEBUG_ACCENT_COLOR,{{apps.accent}}
env = QT_QPA_PLATFORMTHEME,gtk3
env = XCURSOR_THEME,{{apps.cursorTheme}}
env = XCURSOR_SIZE,{{apps.cursorSize}}
